<title>BELARUS: Belarus May unemployment 2.97 pct vs 3.11 pct Apr.</title>
<headline>Belarus May unemployment 2.97 pct vs 3.11 pct Apr.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of unemployed in Belarus fell to 165,213 people or 2.97 percent of the workforce in May from 172,903 people or 3.11 percent of the workforce in April, the Labour Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    OFFICIAL BELARUS UNEMPLOYMENT    May 97   Apr 97   May 96</p>
<p>Number unemployed			  165,213  172,903  175,099</p>
<p>Percentage of workforce		  2.97     3.11     3.15</p>
<p>NOTE-Official figures tend to be understated.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
</text>
